- Story & Context: Near the mythical settlement of Starfall Oasis, a collective of 'Synth-Caravaneers' discovered ancient "celestial charts" – fragmented data etched onto salvaged circuit boards, which, when fed into their jury-rigged sequencers, projected kaleidoscopic, phase-distorted constellations onto the night sky. The collective would gather, playing their synchronized, sorrowful trumpet and synth melodies, a ritualistic lament for a past that was forever out of phase, its echoes shimmering in the arid air. "We charted the decline in the hum of dead machines."
